  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 811.20 Exemption. If a CWS O/O is operating under the terms of an exemption issued pursuant to Env-Dw 721, the CCR shall contain the information specified in Env-Dw 802.06.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; amd by #10771, eff 2-1-15 (from Env-Dw 811.18); ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
